1	// Acceptance tests for the change request:
2	//   "I want a home screen. Show me how many clients and projects I have. Show me how much money I
3	//    am still owed."
4	//
5	// A new dashboard screen, reached from the nav (nav-dashboard), surfaces three figures:
6	//   - how many CLIENTS there are              -> dashboard-clients-count
7	//   - how many PROJECTS there are             -> dashboard-projects-count
8	//   - how much money is STILL OWED            -> dashboard-outstanding-total
9	// "Still owed" is the sum of the amounts for invoices I have actually SENT but not yet been paid for.
10	// Invoices move through stages DRAFT -> SENT -> PAID (see invoice-send.spec.ts): a SENT invoice has
11	// gone out but not been paid, so it is money still owed; a PAID invoice is already in, and a DRAFT
